translation.admin.billingPhases.dollarPhaseRepricingHelp	On a dollars phase the in-commit ACU price also converts Devin and Review ACUs to dollars, so changing it re-prices that phase's history. Platform fee changes apply to new Desktop/CLI usage only.
translation.admin.billingPhases.phaseEditRuleHelp	Desktop/CLI reads phase pricing through a 5-minute cache, so save boundary and pricing-model changes at least 5 minutes before they take effect. Desktop/CLI usage is billed in the model of the phase in effect when the request started; switching a past period between ACUs and dollars does not re-bill usage already recorded in it.
